### 1) MODULE-1.1: DEEP LEARNING MODEL EXTRACTOR 

This module uses the unique concept of the attend, copy, and parse method, which uses pattern matching at its core. The first step involved is using computer vision on the input data to fetch all the information available in the document. The data is stored as it is in the memory as part of the ingestion process. Fig.3 represents the deep learning model extractor In the ingestion process, the OCR result is structured in a hierarchical format, where the lowest level contains individual characters and the higher levels consist of words, paragraphs, and blocks. A two-dimensional plane of each document age is created, and each node at every level of the 

